    "question_text": "[Quantitative Aptitude] A person invested ₹10,000 at 10% compound interest per annum for 2 years compounded annually. What is the compound interest earned? (Variation 3)",
    "options": [
      "₹2,000",
      "₹2,100",
      "₹2,200",
      "₹2,250"
    ],
    "correct_answer": 1,
